Package: glpi-assistant
Version: 3.4.0~rc4-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GLPI Assistant Project
Depends: python3, python3-pip, docker.io, ca-certificates, xdg-utils, util-linux
Description: Self-hosted localhost assistant for GLPI REST API task documentation
 GLPI Assistant runs as a local Docker container bound to 127.0.0.1:8765.
 It parses structured ticket-closing text, maps drag-and-drop evidence files to
 multiple TicketTask records, reads GLPI catalogs dynamically and only changes
 ticket fields explicitly declared in the closing instructions.
